ich may come up in the Azure commit discussion.\n\n---\n\n**Sources:** AWS Cost Explorer (org-wide, grouped by SERVICE, 2026-10-01–2026-11-01), Azure Billing Cache (all subscriptions, 2026-10-01–2026-10-31, refreshed 2026-11-02), GCP BigQuery Billing Export (grouped by SERVICE, 2026-10-01–2026-10-31)"}
